sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant FE as Frontend Dashboard
  participant API as API Video Controller/Service
  participant FS as File Storage uploads/outputs
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Redis/Bull Queue
  participant WK as Worker
  participant FF as FFmpeg
  participant SMTP as SMTP

  U->>FE: select video and click upload
  FE->>API: POST /videos/upload (multipart/form-data)
  API->>FS: save input file in uploads/
  API->>DB: create video_job(status=PENDING,progress=0)
  API->>Q: enqueue job id
  API-->>FE: 201 {id,status,fileName}

  loop polling every 5s
    FE->>API: GET /videos/jobs?page=1&limit=20
    API->>DB: fetch user jobs
    API-->>FE: jobs list
  end

  Q->>WK: deliver job
  WK->>DB: set status=PROCESSING, startedAt
  WK->>FS: read input file
  WK->>FF: transcode to mp4

  alt processing success
    FF-->>WK: output file path + metadata
    WK->>FS: write output in outputs/
    WK->>DB: set status=COMPLETED, progress=100, outputPath
    WK->>SMTP: send success notification
  else processing failure
    FF-->>WK: error
    WK->>DB: set status=FAILED, error message
    WK->>SMTP: send failure notification
  end

  alt user watches/downloads
    FE->>API: GET /videos/watch/:jobId or /videos/download/:jobId
    API->>DB: validate ownership and status COMPLETED
    API->>FS: read output file
    API-->>FE: stream/download video
  end

  alt user deletes job
    FE->>API: DELETE /videos/jobs/:jobId
    API->>DB: validate ownership
    API->>FS: delete input/output files when present
    API->>DB: delete video_job
    API-->>FE: 200 deleted
  end
